{"id":1375900,"shortDescription":"Swarm Grinder es un juego de acción tipo roguelite con gráficos de píxeles que es muy popular aquí en España. Lucha contra enemigos para abrirte paso a través de una masa de células en expansión y evolución que albergan enemigos inactivos. Recoge una variedad de habilidades y mejoras que cambian el juego para crear construcciones únicas.","developers":["Last Bite Games"],"publishers":["Null State Protocol","Gamersky Games"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"22 ABR 2024","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375900/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1784447149","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375900/ss_fb64c13ff3f81c4c92080d5b72521c5ae0e7de82.600x338.jpg?t=1784447149","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375900/ss_fb64c13ff3f81c4c92080d5b72521c5ae0e7de82.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784447149"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375900/ss_b83ee1b7dfc2db07e2b3f9b84558a13c2a41b1d1.600x338.jpg?t=1784447149","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375900/ss_b83ee1b7dfc2db07e2b3f9b84558a13c2a41b1d1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784447149"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375900/ss_2a085ee0dbb132f4b685f3c103a2299192778ec2.600x338.jpg?t=1784447149","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375900/ss_2a085ee0dbb132f4b685f3c103a2299192778ec2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784447149"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375900/ss_f7f8956b77594e119bf95fd109a389e5bfdbb1f2.600x338.jpg?t=1784447149","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375900/ss_f7f8956b77594e119bf95fd109a389e5bfdbb1f2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784447149"},{"thumb":"https://share